  "sourceTitle": "Beurre Manie",
  "sourceText": "Beurre Manie\nBy: Yuna Wu\nPublished: Thursday, December 10, 2009 - 5:20pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 tablespoon softened butter\n1 tablespoon all-purpose flour\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Knead butter and flour together with your hands until it forms a dough\n\nAbout\n\n\nYou can scale this recipe easily as long as you keep the butter and flour ratio 50/50.  \nKeep your beurre manie wrapped and fridged.  Stir it into warm soups to thicken.",
